// Known-good answer (by hand; Qwen failed it 4 times on the delay slots): P6 stage "a_g1_tail", the end of
// grid 1's outer loop, pc 0x590 to the loop branch at 0x5d8 (taken: its delay slot 0x5e0, then 0x288;
